Subject: [PATCH 27/29] D20 regime B: opt-in train.ebops_trace_every k
 (full-split reset trace at zero-based epoch 0, at (epoch+1) % k == 0 and at
 the last epoch; BetaPID reads the in-training EBOPs on untraced epochs;
 feasibility and all selected files at traced epochs only; snapshot cadence a
 multiple of k); [D20] log line carries ebops_trace_seconds,
 ebops_trace_over_epoch and train loss (physics v9 B2); verify_selected skips
 a pause before the first traced epoch; CPU tests

